[Music]  so we are here on the promo shoot for  season three of um the drew barrymore  show i am so excited because the whole  marketing team saw what i did  at the rock and roll hall of fame  to induct the go-go's because they are  my favorite band in the world and  they're the reason i think that i have  all the courage  and bravery  and  edge i don't know just everything about  me stems from them and discovering their  album when i was a kid we're basically  carrying that over to our season 3 promo  with the go-go's blessing in fact i have  their birthday card right here which  means  everything in the world to me and they  came on the show and surprised me  for my birthday i never would have  dreamt anything like this would ever  actually happen it says happiest of  birthdays to our sister  the six go-go  from the go-go's  the thing about the go-go's that i love  the most is they were really cool fun  girls but they had this great sisterhood  and so when i think of like a charlie's  angels i know that that  is what was the impression to me growing  up that like girls did not compete they  worked together  and  didn't try to pretend to be boys but  could do what boys do  like rock and roll and action and all  that stuff we get to be who we are they  kind of taught me everything we're doing  it till we got the beat which the  go-go's signed off on i mean if that's  not the circle of life nothing is  because i'll never forget when i heard  that drum beat for the first time  it opened a door  and changed my life forever  do you remember where you were when you  heard it i was really young and i was at  a friend's house i don't remember who  the friend was but i remember the room  so well it was obviously the album and  it was on a record player i was really  drawn to the album art it was like one  of these what is this  and  that was when i heard that drum beat  when that needle hit the record and  i've never been the same since i was a  big blondie fan too like debbie harry  couldn't have been any cooler there were  so many amazing girls out there just  letting all of us young girls know that  you were capable of anything and  everything was possible it was really  all about the go-go's for me do you ever  want to be like a rock star type when  you're hearing music like that well i  told steven spielberg funny enough i  told him i was a drummer  [Music]  oh my god what if it's because of that  beat in the go-go's that made me think  drummer  i knew my limitations in music  i knew that i would be the biggest music  fan  but that that was not where my strengths  lie  i really don't sing i don't play but i  know music and i love music and i love  putting music to everything i love  making playlists and i made mixtapes oh  i labored on my mixtape so hard when i  was younger everything had to flow into  the next song and did you ever give  someone a mixtape oh my god yes  especially boys besides  acting though was there ever something  else that you're like oh maybe i could  do that  i always wanted to be a writer i was  always writing scripts for steven  spielberg when i was a kid and getting  his take and approval and  you know just seeing what he thought so  i always wanted to write that was i  think my big goal i'm as happy as i  could ever be in my life because of this  show it is  literally a very positive  environment it's fun and it's sassy and  spirited and humorous and surprisingly  emotional  and it's been the most fulfilling  endeavor i could have ever guessed i  can't believe we get to do a season  three  people are like you have way too much  like eggs in the basket of this show and  i'm like  do you have a problem with that  but i just i love coming here i've also  gone from job to job my whole life  which is such a blessing and i've been  so lucky and i've been given so many  damn opportunities but i love coming to  the same place i love the consistency  i've always wanted like a desk job  in that way of like  you know who you're with you know where  you're going it's so consistent i've  always craved that in my life and once i  had kids i knew i had to find that and i  didn't know where i was going to find it  i did not know i was going to find it  here  i love this job so much is there  anything else you want from this new  season that you're really looking  forward to oh my gosh that's such a good  question  professionally  i think this is an incredible time to  figure out what the new media frontier  is  there is never been a time where we had  this many possibilities and resources  we've got social media we've got digital  i think this is the time where  it's time to unclip wings and reinvent  the wheel personally if i can just  be a little less afraid of this going  away  that would be probably really smart  but  it's like to anyone out there who really  loves something and you just want it to  stay  you know and you don't want to lose it  it's the same feeling that's how i feel  about this  [Music]

